<title>POLAND: PLI seeks main market listing.</title>
<headline>PLI seeks main market listing.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-07-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish wholesaler and retailer Polish Life Improvement SA (PLI) has applied to the Warsaw Stock Exchange to transfer to the main market from the bourse's parallel floor, the company said in a statement on Monday.</p>
<p>The bourse's parallel floor lists smaller, less-liquid stocks.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
